Alias K*0sig K*0
Alias anti-K*0sig anti-K*0
ChargeConj K*0sig anti-K*0sig


Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.000 B0sig  anti-B0sig B0 anti-B0  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay


#  delta C_9 = ( 1 , -1 ) for B0
Decay B0sig
1.000 K*0sig e+ e- BTOSLLNPR 0    1 1  -1    10 1  14 1  15 1.23  16 0.73  17 1.5 ;
Enddecay

#  delta C_9 = ( 1 , 1 ) for anti-B0
Decay anti-B0sig
1.000 anti-K*0sig e+ e- BTOSLLNPR 0    1 1  1    10 1  14 1 15 1.23  16 0.73  17 1.5;
Enddecay

Decay K*0sig
1.0 K+ pi- VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-K*0sig

End
